  <title>Listen to Purdue’s repeated rallying cry: Boiler Up!</title>
  <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lC9eJJD95AE"/>
  <author>
   <name>Purdue University</name>
   <uri>https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOSY-LKMuJZn4HGsJZHfQDw</uri>
  </author>
  <published>2026-11-06T13:55:54+00:00</published>
  <updated>2026-11-18T20:01:09+00:00</updated>
  <media:group>
   <media:title>Listen to Purdue’s repeated rallying cry: Boiler Up!</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/lC9eJJD95AE?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i1.ytimg.com/vi/lC9eJJD95AE/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Step inside Mackey Arena, and you’ll feel what makes Purdue basketball special. Thousands of Boilermakers share one goal: cheering Purdue to victory. Here, basketball is more than a game. It’s a tradition that connects generations and brings the Purdue community together. And together, we call “Boiler Up!” 

From tipoff to the final buzzer, Mackey showcases the grit, energy and pride that define Purdue University. Fans fill the stands in old gold and black, rallying behind the Boilermakers through every possession. The excitement reaches far beyond West Lafayette, connecting students, alumni and fans wherever they are (including Zach Edey traveling through the airport). No matter where you watch, you’re part of the Purdue team. 

What makes a Boilermaker? It’s the willingness to put in the work, the determination to respond to a challenge and the resilience to keep improving. Those qualities are on display every time Purdue takes the court. Every play reflects countless hours of preparation and a shared commitment to something greater than any individual. Achievements don’t happen overnight. They’re built through consistent effort, trust and teamwork. 

That mindset extends throughout Purdue. Boilermakers have turned ambitious goals into meaningful progress. On the court and across campus, people come together to tackle challenges, learn from one another and create opportunities for the future. Every contribution matters. 

Learn more: purdue.edu 

Subscribe: youtube.com/@PurdueUniversity 

 

#BoilerUp #Purdue #Basketball</media:description>
